<p>Inserts a string into another string.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/String%20keyword" title="String keyword">string</a> InsertString(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/String%20keyword" title="String keyword">string</a> sDestination,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/String%20keyword" title="String keyword">string</a> sString,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nPosition<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">sDestination<dd>The destination string<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">sString<dd>The string to insert<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nPosition<dd>The position in the destination string to insert at
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>The modified string. Returns an empty string on error.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
</p>
</dl>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns a string which is the string sDestination with the string sString insered at the position index nPosition. This index is 0 indexed, so if nPosition = 0 the string sString will be added to the front of the string sDestination.
</p>
